000700*================================================================*
000800* PROGRAM    : TCB110                                            *
000900* TITLE      : VALIDATE BOND DESK TICKET FEED                    *
001000* JOB        : MSTCD020   STEP010 (IKJEFT01 - DB2 PLAN MSTCPLN)  *
001100*                                                                *
001200* DESCRIPTION:                                                   *
001300*   EDITS THE FIXED INCOME TICKET FILE FROM THE BOND DESK        *
001400*   SYSTEM.  GOOD TICKETS ARE WRITTEN AS NORMALIZED TRADES       *
001500*   (TCTRADE, STATUS VL), BAD TICKETS TO THE REJECT FILE.        *
001600*   N = NEW TICKET, C = CANCEL, A = AMEND (CORRECTION).          *
001700*   THE BOND DESK SENDS 2-DIGIT YEARS - THEY ARE WINDOWED BY     *
001800*   CMU010 FUNCTION W2Y4.  QUANTITY ON THE TRADE IS FACE AMOUNT, *
001900*   PRICE IS PERCENT OF PAR.  THE DESK MAY OVERRIDE ACCRUED      *
002000*   INTEREST (FI-ACCRUED-OVR-FLAG = 'Y').                        *
002100*                                                                *
002200* FILES  : DATECARD  BUSINESS DATE CARD            (CMDATEW)     *
002300*          SYSIN     PARAMETER CARDS TCP110A                     *
002400*          FIFEED    MSEC.PROD.TC.FIFEED.RAW(0)    (TCFIFD)      *
002500*          ACCTMAST  MSEC.PROD.CM.ACCTMAST.KSDS    (CMACCT)      *
002600*          TRADEOUT  MSEC.PROD.TC.FI.VALID(+1)     (TCTRADE)     *
002700*          REJOUT    MSEC.PROD.TC.REJECTS.FI(+1)   (TCREJCT)     *
002800* CALLS  : CMD010 CMU010 CMU050 CMU060 CMU080 CMASM02            *
002900*                                                                *
003000* RETURN CODES: 0 CLEAN  4 REJECTS  8 TRAILER OUT OF BALANCE     *
003100*----------------------------------------------------------------*
